{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"2507950","name":"三角洲行动 ","type":"game","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>战术干员，硬核撤离</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/652f6c335d66eb9209730063a330a9e3.poster.avif?t=1779265091\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/652f6c335d66eb9209730063a330a9e3.webm?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/652f6c335d66eb9209730063a330a9e3.mp4?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入G.T.I.（全球应急行动组织），集结各怀绝技的精英干员。无论你是用侦察箭索敌、磁吸炸弹爆破，还是启动动力外骨骼强行冲阵—灵活运用战术道具与队友协同，在险象环生的撤离任务中智胜对手。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>前所未有的搜刮乐趣</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/0a3769c06708785f035665e2736bae83.poster.avif?t=1779265091\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/0a3769c06708785f035665e2736bae83.webm?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/0a3769c06708785f035665e2736bae83.mp4?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >重燃对战利品的原始渴望。探索动态地图，破解密码，上天掏鸟窝，下海摸蚌壳。每一次出击都是一场未知的寻宝博弈，将单纯的搜刮升格为肾上腺素狂飙的冒险。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>智取首领，枪火制胜</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/1714c15ede69196c9325adca67d2d84d.poster.avif?t=1779265091\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/1714c15ede69196c9325adca67d2d84d.webm?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/1714c15ede69196c9325adca67d2d84d.mp4?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >直面全副武装的佣兵与残暴首领，夺取高价值物资。但请时刻保持警惕—最致命的猎手往往是和你一样觊觎战利品的敌对玩家。只有活到最后的赢家，才配拥有财富。富贵，险中求。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>撤离路线，由你掌控</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/181965c4720d88928eb6fb1254f70a37.poster.avif?t=1779265091\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/181965c4720d88928eb6fb1254f70a37.webm?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/181965c4720d88928eb6fb1254f70a37.mp4?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >撤离是一门艺术。告别枯燥的定点撤离—你可以发射巨型火箭升空，身着飞鼠装高空滑翔，或是穿越地下管网隐秘潜行。在混乱战场中随机应变，用最意想不到的方式全身而退。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>满载而归，升级你的特勤处</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/289b106705999bcd156696ec829ae7c9.poster.avif?t=1779265091\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/289b106705999bcd156696ec829ae7c9.webm?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/289b106705999bcd156696ec829ae7c9.mp4?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >生存只是第一步。利用带出的物资升级特勤处，扩充军火库容，强化身体机能并解锁尖端装备。每一次积累都将转化为战场优势，助你以更强姿态、更精良装备重返前线。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>海陆空三栖，主宰全面战场</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/2b05bc4cc804393046d6c09d3b9cbf43.poster.avif?t=1779265091\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/2b05bc4cc804393046d6c09d3b9cbf43.webm?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/2b05bc4cc804393046d6c09d3b9cbf43.mp4?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >投身全面战场，体验64人的史诗级宏大对决。驾驶坦克和直升机穿梭于城市街道、山巅和广阔岛屿之间。在支持全场景破坏的地图上，体验无缝衔接的纯粹战斗快感。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>海量军械，极致改装</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/8e83034ce18c8e074872ef74de8a7d5f.poster.avif?t=1779265091\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/8e83034ce18c8e074872ef74de8a7d5f.webm?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/8e83034ce18c8e074872ef74de8a7d5f.mp4?t=1779265091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在资深军事顾问的协助下，数十把枪械、每把武器超10种改装部位，超1000种搭配，创造并分享你独特的改装方案。不止于枪械，你还可以改装海陆空载具。定制专属军火库，按你的方式主宰战场。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【写在最后的话，来自制作人Shadow】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>作为玩家：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《三角洲特种部队》是我玩过的第一款射击游戏，它开启了我对射击游戏的热爱和梦想。我非常珍惜制作这款《三角洲行动》的机会，希望能让更多玩家体验到那种难忘的游戏乐趣。我想要新三角洲成为这个宏大的射击世界。 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>作为制作人：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们希望做出Unreal的极致表现，做到真正的跨端，能让全球玩家领略到丰富战术策略、有深度的角色、战场破坏、顶级动作……对得起“下一代”射击称号。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望你们和我一起，共同打造出这款属于所有三角洲玩家的《三角洲行动》。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/51ac592ab2c221a1542673d54888c2a3cc240604/header_alt_assets_11_schinese.jpg?t=1779265091","website":"https://www.playdeltaforce.com","developers":["Team Jade"],"publishers":["TiMi Studio Group"],"release_date":"2024 年 12 月 4 日","coming_soon":false,"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 简体中文<strong>*</strong>, 法语, 德语, 俄语, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲, 阿拉伯语, 日语, 韩语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 繁体中文, 土耳其语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","多人","大型多人在线","玩家对战","线上玩家对战","合作","在线合作","跨平台多人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","Steam 集换式卡牌","应用内购买"],"genres":["动作","冒险","大型多人在线","免费开玩"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i3-4150 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 660 / AMD HD 7870 / Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>网络:</strong> 宽带互联网连接<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 88 GB 可用空间</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 / AMD Ryzen 5 1500x<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 1060 5G / AMD RX5500 XT / Intel Arc A580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 88 GB 可用空间</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/ss_88d7ff2529260f5782f0fb842ccc78cc09bfba59.600x338.jpg?t=1779265091","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/ss_88d7ff2529260f5782f0fb842ccc78cc09bfba59.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779265091"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/ss_2a9fffcd74fb94896bd77a199cd4a7b5033eb8a0.600x338.jpg?t=1779265091","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/ss_2a9fffcd74fb94896bd77a199cd4a7b5033eb8a0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779265091"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/ss_9bad18d36609072b2b9d50816e75cce81b6e4b0f.600x338.jpg?t=1779265091","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/ss_9bad18d36609072b2b9d50816e75cce81b6e4b0f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779265091"}]}